DOC|subsystem_web_network|v1|updated=2026-04-13
META|inertia=LOW|parent=architecture_root.dsb
META|files=web/server.py,network/listener.py,network/discord_bot.py

DESIGN_POINTS|
  DP1|web server is output channel not control plane; Igor pulls from queue; server pushes to browser
  DP2|per-client asyncio.Queue fan-out: _broadcast() → loop.call_soon_threadsafe(q.put_nowait) for each client
  DP3|CC bridge: POST /api/cc_send {"content":"..."} injects as author=claude-code
  DP4|all network messages normalized to NetworkMessage dataclass before entering main loop
  DP5|thread workers: each network turn runs in thread; exception caught by worker; web_server.send() must not be in try block that swallows exceptions

WEB_SERVER|
  file=web/server.py|Starlette+uvicorn|port=IGOR_WEB_PORT=8080
  endpoints=GET /(chat UI)|WS /ws|POST /api/cc_send|POST /api/upload|GET /api/outbox[/{file}]|GET /api/dashboard
  public_api=web_server.send(text,thread_id)|web_server.broadcast_activity(state)
  activity_state=current_action,current_tier,memory_count,habit_count,milieu_state
  fallback=embedded HTML when Svelte dist/ not built

LISTENER|
  file=network/listener.py|unified incoming queue
  polling=0.5s idle loop|drains Discord+web queues into shared incoming Queue
  thread=daemon thread with own asyncio loop

DISCORD|
  file=network/discord_bot.py
  events=on_message,slash commands
  queues=NetworkMessage to incoming queue

PATHS|
  inbox=~/.TheIgors/Igor-wild-0001/inbox/|InboxWatcher detects new files every 5s|salience=0.9
  outbox=~/.TheIgors/Igor-wild-0001/outbox/|Igor writes files here for download

KNOWN_FAILURES|F008(web-no-response),F011(web-no-response-general)
